.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-doctor-toolchain 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-doctor\-toolchain \- Diagnose whether every tool the manifest declares is installed
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten doctor toolchain\fR [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fImanifest\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Diagnose whether every tool the manifest declares is installed
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fImanifest\fR>
The manifest whose declared tool table to read
